{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"499814","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/499814","key":"MC-301735","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"01/Sep/25 6:34 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>According to the information provided by the rpc.discover command, the kick command should require an array as input. This would be consistent with other similar commands.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Steps to reproduce the issue</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>setup the Management protocol</li>\n\t<li>Attempt to send a kick command as described by the command discovery<br>\nKick parameters provided by discovery:\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\"><span class=\"code-quote\">\"params\"</span>: [\n  {\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"kick\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"schema\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"items\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"code-quote\">\"$ref\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"#/components/schemas/kick_player\"</span>\n      },\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"array\"</span>\n    },\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"required\"</span>: <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\n  }\n]</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>Example payload that produces the error: </p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\">{<span class=\"code-quote\">\"method\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:players/kick\"</span>,<span class=\"code-quote\">\"id\"</span>:0,<span class=\"code-quote\">\"params\"</span>:[[{<span class=\"code-quote\">\"players\"</span>:[{<span class=\"code-quote\">\"name\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"jSdCool\"</span>}],<span class=\"code-quote\">\"message\"</span>:{<span class=\"code-quote\">\"literal\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"kick test\"</span>}}]]}</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Expected result</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The target player is kicked from the server</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Actual result</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The following error is received due to the fact the server was expecting an object not an array</p>\n\n<p>Invalid params: Not a JSON object: [{\"players\":[</p>\n{\"name\":\"jSdCool\"}\n<p>],\"message\":{\"literal\":\"kick test\"}}]</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":null,"customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"23/Sep/25 7:31 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"11/Mar/26 3:44 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Server Management Protocol Kick command parameter mis match","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-301735/watchers","watchCount":0,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":4,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2025-09-01T18:34:49.493-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/12270","value":"Platform HC","id":"12270"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"According to the information provided by the rpc.discover command, the kick command should require an array as input. This would be consistent with other similar commands."}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Steps to reproduce the issue"}]}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"setup the Management protocol"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Attempt to send a kick command as described by the command discovery"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Kick parameters provided by discovery:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"params\": [\n  {\n    \"name\": \"kick\",\n    \"schema\": {\n      \"items\": {\n        \"$ref\": \"#/components/schemas/kick_player\"\n      },\n      \"type\": \"array\"\n    },\n    \"required\": true\n  }\n]"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Example payload that produces the error: "}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"json"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"method\":\"minecraft:players/kick\",\"id\":0,\"params\":[[{\"players\":[{\"name\":\"jSdCool\"}],\"message\":{\"literal\":\"kick test\"}}]]}"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Expected result"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The target player is kicked from the server"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Actual result"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The following error is received due to the fact the server was expecting an object not an array"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Invalid params: Not a JSON object: [{\"players\":[{\"name\":\"jSdCool\"}],\"message\":{\"literal\":\"kick test\"}}]"}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https:/